        "description": "The browser's view of a session event, streamed by `GET\n/api/chat/events/{session_id}`.\n\n`ToSchema` publishes the 22 tag values to the OpenAPI document, so the\nbrowser reads the union from the enum instead of repeating it."
      },
      "FsEvent": {
        "oneOf": [
